              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lebhanti lelembu elihle lentambo ephothiweyo eluhlaza leyibubende lebomvu, kube ngumsebenzi womthungi, njengokutsho kweNkosi kuMose. ",
          "type": "text",
