        {
          "text": "izambatho ezenziweyo kuhle zokukhonza endaweni engcwele, izambatho ezingcwele zikaAroni umpristi, lezambatho zamadodana akhe ukuba babe ngabapristi bokuphatha umsebenzi wobupristi. ",
